    "family_reading": {
        "text": "Nous Hermes is a small, text only family from Nous, with 3 versions in the OpenRouter catalog and open weights published for every version. All 3 share a 131072 token context window, and 1 of the 3 supports reasoning. The newest version, Hermes 4 405B, is the reasoning one, and it also raises maximum output to 117964 tokens, far above the 16384 tokens of the two Hermes 3 releases. Prices run from $0.7 per million input and output for Hermes 3 70B Instruct up to $1 input and $3 output for Hermes 4 405B. The facts suggest the family suits long text work that needs open weights, with the 70B tier as the cheaper option and the 405B tiers for heavier tasks. Limits are clear: text only, no image or audio input, and reasoning costs more on output.",
